  "description": "IJOKUQ crystallizes in the tetragonal crystal system with space group P 42/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C320 H288 Dy16 N24 O96 P24,10(C1 H4 O1),12(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy1F (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy2F (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy3F (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy4F (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy1G (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy2G (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy3G (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy4G (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy1A (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy2A (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy3A (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy4A (Dy) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 8 pairs, 8 components; largest component is a chain with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.880-4.199 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 107.88-123.28°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C330H340Dy16N24O118P24.",
